        },
        {
          "text": "azize ivyaha vyiwe yakoze, kuko yakora ivyo Uhoraho abona kw ari bibi, akagendera mu ngeso za Yerobowamu no mu vyaha vyiwe yakora abikwegeramwo n’ Abisirayeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
